@title Ecks vs. Sever (USA) (En,Fr,De,Es,It)
@file Ecks vs. Sever (U) (M5).gba
@game AESE
@chip none (password game: no save library string, SINGLE-PLAYER offers NEW GAME / PASSWORD)
@save none
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
# Logos, ENGLISH, PRESS START, SINGLE-PLAYER > NEW GAME, the default
# character, the story and mission cards (START through them), the warehouse
# street: walk forward, fire once, pause, resume, turn right and walk.
# Notes: the main menu fades in at a different step in each emulator at f2818
# and meets at f2938. From the first walk (f4809) mgba stands a step further
# on than dingbat-bios and the second reference, which stay on the same frame
# (movement follows the game's rendered frame rate, as in Doom).

[new]
wait 600
checkpoint legal window=30
wait 400
wait 600
press START
wait 300
wait 400
checkpoint language window=30
press A
wait 200
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 120
wait 120
checkpoint main_menu window=30
press A
wait 120
wait 120
checkpoint new_or_password window=30
press A
wait 240
checkpoint character window=30
press A
wait 240
checkpoint story window=30
press START
wait 200
checkpoint mission_card window=30
press START
wait 200
checkpoint objectives window=30
press START
wait 200
checkpoint mission_start window=30
press UP hold=90
wait 5
press A hold=10
wait 30
checkpoint walk_fire window=30
press START hold=10
wait 60
checkpoint paused window=30
press START hold=10
wait 30
press RIGHT hold=30
press UP hold=90
wait 5
checkpoint turn_walk window=30

